<title>LEBANON: Solidere shares mixed on lower turnover.</title>
<headline>Solidere shares mixed on lower turnover.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solidere shares were mixed on sharply decreased turnover on the Beirut Stock Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>A shares rose slightly to $113.25 from Friday's $113 and B shares fell to $115.125 from $117.125.</p>
<p>Turnover in Solidere shares fell sharply to 10,605 shares from 34,246 on Friday and value was $1,212,164.75 from $3,925,423.25.</p>
<p>There was no trade in the shares of the four other listed companies: Ciments Libanais,  Ciments Blancs, Eternit and Uniceramic.</p>
<p>The LISPI stock index fell 0.21 percent to 82.53 and the BLOM stock index also fell 0.65 percent to 960.38.</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (9611) 353078 645456 602057</p>
